{"id":"womo_glich","lemma":"womöglich","pos":"adv","rank":2192,"glosses":["possibly"],"ipa":"/voːˈmøːklɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5c/De-wom%C3%B6glich.ogg/De-wom%C3%B6glich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Könnte dies womöglich wieder passieren?","en":"Could this possibly happen again?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,null,{"g":"again"},{"g":"to happen"}]},{"text":"Ich hätte womöglich die Polizei früher anrufen sollen.","en":"I probably should've called the police sooner.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"formerly, in the past"},{"g":"to call, to ring"},{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Könnte dies womöglich wieder geschehen?","en":"Could this possibly happen again?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,null,{"g":"again"},{"g":"to occur"}]},{"text":"Womöglich sollte ich aufhören, Liebesromane zu lesen.","en":"I think that maybe I should stop reading romance novels.","words":[null,{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to stop"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Die Leute werden dich womöglich für einen Dummkopf halten, wenn du das tust.","en":"People might think you're stupid if you do that.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"airhead"},{"g":"to hold"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]}]}